      "versionNonce": 261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793529553217,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET /notifications -> index()\nGET /notifications/unread -> unread()\nPATCH /notifications/{notification}/read -> read()\n\nindex/unread memakai snapshot membership satu operasi.\nSetiap kartu tetap Gate update; recipient pribadi wajib.\ntenantOptions(): scoped UNION, tanpa exists() per tenant.\nScope snapshot dibuang sebelum operasi/job berikutnya.",
      "originalText": "GET /notifications -> index()\nGET /notifications/unread -> unread()\nPATCH /notifications/{notification}/read -> read()\n\nindex/unread memakai snapshot membership satu operasi.\nSetiap kartu tetap Gate update; recipient pribadi wajib.\ntenantOptions(): scoped UNION, tanpa exists() per tenant.\nScope snapshot dibuang sebelum operasi/job berikutnya.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
